    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >[Summary]</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They were taken away as food for Vampire. It is a prison.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They put me in a cell and I can't move around freely.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you stay there, the Vampire will continue to suck your blood and you will eventually die!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve the traps and riddles that obstruct your escape and try to get to the exit!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you escape from a guarded prison?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Escape from the Vampire's prison and escape from the Vampire's prison!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vampires will appear and attack you while you are exploring the prison!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you encounter a Vampire, run away and hide yourself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vampires patrol the prison, so it is important to understand their behavior patterns.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Advance without being noticed.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Use items to avoid danger!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You may get items and hints during your search.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let's search and get items to avoid danger!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
